  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/035dff541ababaea81e68d94debb25e52fa3de55.png\" alt=\"扩展战斗暮色森林插件标题图片\" width=\"600\" height=\"130\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fec-lec-plugin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"可在 Modrinth 获取\" width=\"187\" height=\"64\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.1.2/assets/cozy/requires/cloth-config-api_64h.png\" alt=\"需要 Cloth Config API\" width=\"242\" height=\"64\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5aec5c41ae6f0aac946a80fe3cf688a7a336fa09_0.webp\" alt=\"需要 Curios API\" width=\"195\" height=\"64\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexpanded-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/59e9eeade55f309be535f0b860f0219c8863d4b0_0.webp\" alt=\"需要 Expanded Combat\" width=\"288\" height=\"64\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l_ender-s-cataclysm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4cf9a8785d4e073542b20458847cc819116fffcd_0.webp\" alt=\"需要 Cataclysm\" width=\"198\" height=\"64\"></a></p></div>\n<p>一款为<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexpanded-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Expanded Combat</a>添加兼容性的插件模组，支持<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l_ender-s-cataclysm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender's Cataclysm</a>中的 Ignitium 材料。</p>\n<h4><strong>新增以下材料支持：</strong></h4>\n<p>Ignitium - 由我的主模组<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexpanded-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Expanded Combat</a>添加的护盾、箭袋与拳套。<br>\nCursium - 护盾、箭袋与拳套<br>\nWitherite - 拳套与箭袋<br>\n紫水晶蟹壳 - 拳套<br>\n黑钢 - 护盾与武器</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5><strong>重要提示：</strong></h5>\n<p><strong>如需报告错误，请使用 GitHub 上的问题追踪器：<a href=\"https://github.com/userofbricks/Expanded-Combat/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>如需聊天或交流其他事宜，请加入 Discord：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/7cR4Vwv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>点击横幅获取折扣：</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fuserofbricks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/c94a16d8-7267-4fc5-bf4a-b064ecdd546a.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
